WEBVTT

00:06:59.788 --> 00:07:03.454
So you can sort of describe a fuzzy thing
and it'll understand documents.

00:07:03.496 --> 00:07:07.121
It can understand, you know, short
documents, not full books yet,

00:07:07.163 --> 00:07:09.038
but bring you back to the context
of what you want.

00:07:09.579 --> 00:07:11.371
There's been a lot of excitement
about using

00:07:11.371 --> 00:07:14.913
the generative capabilities
to create sort of games

00:07:14.913 --> 00:07:18.913
or sort of interactive stories or letting
people develop characters

00:07:18.913 --> 00:07:21.371
or chat with a sort of virtual friend.

00:07:21.704 --> 00:07:23.996
There are applications that, for example,

00:07:23.996 --> 00:07:28.371
help a job seeker polish a tailored
application for each individual company.

00:07:28.788 --> 00:07:32.788
There's the beginning of tutors that can
sort of teach people about different